Apply manifests

Usage: etch apply [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -m, --manifests <MANIFESTS>  Run a subset of your manifests, comma separated list. This should be a list of manifest names. No paths
      --dry-run                Performs a dry-run without changing the system
  -l, --label <LABEL>          Define label selector
      --json                   Output results as JSON
  -v, --verbose                Show all actions including those with nothing to do
  -h, --help                   Print help
